  "description": "meme-id: 1-800-abos-r-dum; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme juxtaposes a person in Native American regalia with a Black man in formal attire, using text that mocks the pronunciation of '1-800-abos-r-dum' as a racial slur. The text 'do you hate yourself?' and 'doubt science & established historical records?' is used to imply that the Black man is ignorant or irrational, which constitutes a hateful attack based on race. The meme relies on racial stereotypes and uses the image of the Black man to reinforce a derogatory message, targeting him based on his race.",
